{"id":"f90a8b0b-7dcb-4512-877c-e36106275b7f","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:24:31.192Z","document":{"plugin":"article","state":{"introduction":{"plugin":"articleIntroduction","state":{"explanation":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ein Kreisdiagramm (auch Tortendiagramm genannt) ist eine Darstellung von Daten mithilfe von "},{"type":"a","href":"/36264","children":[{"text":"Kreissektoren"}]},{"text":"."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Im Kreisdiagramm stellt der gesamte Kreis den Gesamtwert aller Daten dar. Der Kreis wird in Sektoren eingeteilt. "}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Größe der einzelnen Sektoren entspricht dann dem Anteil am Ganzen. "}]}],"id":"dcc58ead-de76-4088-894b-af09b5cc1755"},"multimedia":{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f6ca300b2ebf_3a0c86f3a405a5ae0fe3c615c5f4acd27a874727.png","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"a326505e-b78b-4bf1-bbb3-d2073d248d70"}},"id":"f5e307db-56d4-4fc3-ab89-4c13d4313e5e"},"illustrating":true,"width":50},"id":"c91d0b3b-f7a9-45f0-96e7-4d0486d218b9"},"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":2,"children":[{"text":"Wie erstellt man ein Kreisdiagramm?"}]}],"id":"1b7c0dfe-23f4-4cff-97e8-951c8381eef1"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"ordered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":"Bestimme die Winkelgrößen der einzelnen Sektoren."}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":"Zeichne einen Kreis mit dem Zirkel."}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":"Zeichne die Sektoren mithilfe der Winkelgrößen in den Kreis."}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":"Füge eine Beschriftung hinzu, damit es übersichtlicher wird."}]}]}]}],"id":"e63c9f43-5a4e-4a18-a0ac-c3e72b1a2127"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Anhand dieser Werte kannst du dann die einzelnen Sektoren mit deren Winkelgrößen eintragen."}]}],"id":"584ccdd9-62c5-49ef-9ad1-d99413965246"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":2,"children":[{"text":"Winkelgröße bestimmen"}]}],"id":"25b7eeba-3fb2-42f3-981f-b23d8600ba4a"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Angegeben sind die Daten für das Kreisdiagramm entweder in Prozent oder als absolute Wert."}]}],"id":"b4bd5961-7922-4cc8-b66d-92176b53ceb6"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Berechnung mit "},{"text":"Prozentangabe","strong":true},{"text":":"}]}],"id":"3e7de8e2-ea4f-4553-b056-8ec7daca351c"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{Winkel} = \textrm{Prozentangabe in \% }\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"0b2021d0-9f8a-49b6-9459-33e3e5a355aa"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Achte darauf, dass die Prozentangaben zusammen "},{"type":"math","src":"100\%","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"100%"}]},{"text":" ergeben."}]}],"id":"f8ca580c-0c31-4eb2-95cb-b66c48ffde6f"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Berechnung mit "},{"text":"absolutem Wert","strong":true},{"text":":"}]}],"id":"ea06e91e-2d9e-4f7e-b13d-5a8e5959170f"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{Winkel} = \dfrac{\textrm{absoluter Wert }\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ}{\textrm{Gesamtwert}}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"20369c38-7c34-4045-9d75-bdaf7abf6503"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der Gesamtwert errechnet sich aus der Summer der absoluten Werte."}]}],"id":"75f8bf50-dfa4-4803-95b7-6e7383df31a7"},{"plugin":"spoiler","state":{"title":"Ein Beispiel mit absoluten Werten","content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Gegeben","strong":true},{"text":" ist die durchschnittliche Zeit pro Woche (in Stunden), die ein Schüler für bestimmte Aktivitäten nutzt."}]}],"id":"05b70bfd-1fa9-4a83-ae0e-1bcf2ffb2b4d"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Schule und Hausaufgaben: "},{"type":"math","src":"37 \textrm{ h}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"37 h"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zeit mit Familie: "},{"type":"math","src":" 18 \textrm{ h}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"18 h"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""Chillen": "},{"type":"math","src":"15 \textrm{ h}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"15 h"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zocken und Fernsehen:  "},{"type":"math","src":"13 \textrm{ h}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"13 h"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Hobbys und Haustiere: "},{"type":"math","src":"7 \textrm{ h}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"7 h"}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"df4f3b01-695a-4c56-90ee-f9e0b13e1e22"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Gesucht","strong":true},{"text":" ist der Gesamtwert und die jeweiligen Winkel, um das Kreisdiagramm zeichnen zu können."}]}],"id":"2f9c49a6-ba57-4d44-8442-8abfdc3fa8b0"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Aus gegebenen Werten kann man nun den Gesamtwert errechnen:"}]}],"id":"2f9f8164-d4a2-42d2-ae5b-2d6875c6a935"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
\textrm{Gesamtwert} &=& 37\textrm{ h }+ 18\textrm{ h }+15\textrm{ h }+13\textrm{ h }+7\textrm{ h }
\\&=& 90\textrm{ h }
\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"Gesamtwert ="}]},{"text":" "}]}],"id":"6ee42fd2-f876-4c6e-917d-ad47575e5c20"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Jetzt hat man alle Werte, die man zum Errechnen der Winkel braucht:"}]}],"id":"121a3042-af49-4729-b105-3681ee0236f2"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Schule und Hausaufgaben: "},{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{   }\alpha=\dfrac{37 \textrm{ h}\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ}{90\textrm{ h}} = 148^\circ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"f764c33d-ca40-484b-91ef-ada8d01cf29f"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zeit mit Familie: "},{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{   }\beta=\dfrac{18 \textrm{ h}\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ}{90\textrm{ h}} = 72^\circ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"278158b4-c103-44a8-9995-abd6af0de31a"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""Chillen": "},{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{   }\gamma=\dfrac{15 \textrm{ h}\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ}{90\textrm{ h}} = 60^\circ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"bd5b13f9-0cd9-41fd-bbc7-aa721c007350"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zocken und Fernsehen: "},{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{   }\delta=\dfrac{13 \textrm{ h}\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ}{90\textrm{ h}} = 52^\circ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"a1810bf1-c924-4f49-9e2b-a4608fba5153"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Hobbies und Haustiere: "},{"type":"math","src":"\textrm{   }\epsilon=\dfrac{7 \textrm{ h}\cdot \textrm{ }360^\circ}{90\textrm{ h}} = 28^\circ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"9f63d833-5345-4d00-bab8-41c2fdaef949"}],"id":"d56b6a1e-944b-4f51-9b3f-0438f691355f"}},"id":"df529c84-6477-4644-87e3-399e91fee055"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":2,"children":[{"text":"Einzeichnen der Winkel"}]}],"id":"e64fc781-e7d8-470e-b924-0e9db672784c"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Um ein Kreisdiagramm zu zeichnen, brauchst du ein Geodreieck und einen Zirkel."}]}],"id":"674e309e-8d72-469f-80e5-6a5e187d2c6a"},{"plugin":"multimedia","state":{"explanation":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Kreis zeichnen"}]}],"id":"227d1f95-ea77-462a-b0e3-1f677f6b76a0"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Als erstes zeichnest du den Kreis mit deinem Zirkel."}]}],"id":"820ac90a-ea65-4662-935a-c5da48304011"}],"id":"3881e4e4-7a2a-4ea9-8005-6e4e8d02c163"},"multimedia":{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f6f05d5ecc1f_b44506fe7919c5784e278522c6772227cc5495f2.png","alt":"Kreis zeichnen","maxWidth":290,"caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"ac2a7e5d-a478-4547-a8c5-a6498f5c2b49"}},"id":"6d93a96a-5471-4799-bc3f-8fb6bb6e214f"},"illustrating":true,"width":50},"id":"180e0e69-fdd7-4dd3-881b-6126f8c4f644"},{"plugin":"multimedia","state":{"explanation":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Anfangslinie zeichnen"}]}],"id":"c7f7875d-c365-4c30-878d-06c7a66a359b"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Danach kannst du dir den Beginn des ersten Abschnittes selbst aussuchen. "}]}],"id":"e298ee45-ce16-4274-8cfd-3ec134253786"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Dabei musst du eine Linie beginnend vom Mittelpunkt des Kreises bis zum Rand zeichnen."}]}],"id":"c097afb6-62f8-4b0e-aa11-04d7b7925519"}],"id":"d237ce37-aa45-4380-ba73-ce62db342a85"},"multimedia":{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f6f063c43055_05ccab07eb0ef4987dc1985a34fa745bd606bd9f.png","alt":"erste Linie zeichnen","maxWidth":290,"caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"6b455a1a-d269-4e0a-ad91-67508321e6c8"}},"id":"a78796a1-efc5-47db-9233-f27c3ca82085"},"illustrating":true,"width":50},"id":"f51b8fbf-00c4-4718-89c6-e3d31c89fa96"},{"plugin":"multimedia","state":{"explanation":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Geodreieck anlegen"}]}],"id":"d0ae8c9f-208a-4f8b-92ae-7b1659eae8f7"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Als nächstes legst du dein Geodreieck an die Linie an."}]}],"id":"61a07b0f-9a81-47b9-bbd8-639329060e88"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Achte dabei darauf, dass die Null des Geodreiecks am Mittelpunkt des Kreises liegt."}]}],"id":"68c36b90-1002-4718-ba22-7c4319bd6316"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"In vorherigem Beispiel war der erste Winkel "},{"type":"math","src":"\alpha=148^{\circ}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":"."}]}],"id":"2b774830-9107-4b22-9643-432908d1b87e"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ließ den Winkel ab, in dem du (in diesem Fall) den inneren Gradangaben im Uhrzeigersinn folgst bis du bei "},{"type":"math","src":"148^{\circ}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" angekommen bist."}]}],"id":"c9d003b9-2a21-4de2-995d-8c62f05986ac"}],"id":"f310ce18-fb84-4794-8b3b-b9f50f6f871d"},"multimedia":{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f6f0672e5627_acdf5b1813989cced3f7737941c5aeeb40d95bc4.png","alt":"Geodreieck anlegen","maxWidth":350,"caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"97fbf7cf-4d50-490c-a759-0a12e137fe25"}},"id":"9f24ca49-b0d3-44ac-803f-bd05583a2ff6"},"illustrating":true,"width":50},"id":"9a13d583-9d0b-49e9-b631-224ecc6cf165"},{"plugin":"multimedia","state":{"explanation":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Alpha einzeichen"}]}],"id":"dfc4e19c-289c-4ef8-b138-03c232f1a0e5"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Markiere dir den Punkt und zeichne eine Linie, die am Mittelpu